        "answer": {
          "short": "$pr$. Multiply along the path giving $A$ in both stages.",
          "worked": "The two branches are successive stages of one path, so their probabilities are multiplied.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(A\\text{ in both stages})&=pr\\end{align*}$$",
